      "question": {
        ":question/problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by \n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 6 & -4 & 8 \\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce $M$ to row echelon form.",
